        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshidi yawaYuda anayisoneki nansonekesu yachikuŋu nansa yadiyamondi. Anayisoneki hamalola awubasa anyichima yawu, nihanseŋu jatumeŋa twenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iku anyanawu adi nakwanuka tumeŋa twawu ninyiyombu yawu kunyitondu yituuta hamapidi amalehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mpidi yami yidi mumpata, nukuhana maheteyi niyuma yeyi yalema yejima yiikali yakubuwa tuhu, niyinaŋanaŋa yeyi, mwahita ŋinza jeyi jejima, muloŋa wanshidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi, yeyi aweni kwaamu, wakaketuka kuwuswana weyi nakwinkeli. Ami nakakwinka mudimu wakukalakela ayilumbu jeyi mwituŋa diwabula kwiluka, muloŋa munabutuli dehi kesi mukuzuwa kwami, kesi kakwila bidime-e haya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Muntu wakuhwelela mukwawu muntu, wadikoleshela kumujimba, wukweti muchima wakwambuka kudi Yehova, washiŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yena wakekala neyi kamusasachi kamuchinkalampata, chiyakenza yayiwahi hakayimonaku, wakashakama kwindi hakaweŋeleŋi homa chau mumpata yela kwamuŋwa hohu, yakadi kushakama antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakuhwelela Yehova, wakwila chikuhwelela chindi yowu Yehova hohu, wakooleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yena wakekala neyi mutondu wakutumba kumeji, watanjika nyiji yindi kukaloŋa; chikukwinza nkanza hakatiya womaku, mafu indi saŋa atúutilawu zo-o. Hamwaka wayaaŋa hakaakamaku, hakaleka kusoŋa nyikabuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchima wasweja kudimbana, wadimbana chakubadika yuma yejima, wasweja nikukata, wukutwesha kuwiluka hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Yehova yami nasandojolaŋa mumuchima, yami nesekaŋa mwaya yitoŋojoka, kulonda niyinki antu ejima yashikila muyuma yakoŋaŋawu, yashikila munyikabu yayuma yelaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakuŋulaŋayi gwadi anyana akadi kuteta yena, dichi chadiyi nimuntu wahetaŋa maheta ambala awakwawu, akamufuma hakachi kamafuku indi, hakukuminina kwindi wakekala chisupi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itanda dawanta dalema, dashawu hewulu kufumisha kutachi, diku kumalaletu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, chikuhwelela chawaIsarela, antu ejima akukuleka akatiya nsonyi. Antu akafuma kudami akayisoneka hamaseki muloŋa analeki dehi Yehova, kaseloki kameji amomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋuki eyi Yehova, nakakola. Ŋamwini, nakahanda, muloŋa eyi yeyi nashimeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋadi nakuŋila nawu, Izu daYehova didi kudihi? Dinzi dinu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami kwami hinanyakali kufuma kuwubiŋa wamunyima yeyuku; ifuku dakumona kukala hinadikeŋi kwamuku; eyi aweni wuneluki. Chuma chafumini kunyivumbu yami chadiŋi kumesu eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wikala mukwakunfwisha mutentuku. Mwakubatami nami mwifuku dakala mwomudeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ánkabishaŋa tiyi nsonyi, ami bayi nitiya nsonyuku. Wena akami, ami bayi nakamaku. Yileteli ifuku ayatama, yijilumuni chakuyijilumuna kayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋila nindi, Yaku wakemani muchisu champwembu yawanyana kawantu ami, cheŋililaŋawu anyanta awaYuda, chochedikilaŋawu nawa, nimuyisu yejima yampwembu yaYerusalema; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakayili neyi, Enu anyanta awaYuda, ninenu aYuda ejima, ninenu ejima mwashakama muYerusalema, mweŋililaŋa muyisu iyi, tiyenu izu daYehova; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Babalenu, kusendayiteli hefuku dasabata hela kuyiŋŋa muyisu yampwembu yaYerusalema, chinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwidisha yiteli mumatalenu hefuku dasabata, hela kukoŋa mudimu, chinjila. Chiŋa mujilikaŋa ifuku dasabata mwomunalejeli ankakulula jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa wena kutiya, hela kuteŋelekaku matu awu nehi, achini chikishili kwawu nshiŋu jawu kulonda abuli kutiya, abuli kuyileja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Neyi mwakatiyilila chachiwahi kudami nakubula kwiŋija yiteli muyisu yampwembu yamukaliwu hefuku dasabata, himukujilika ifuku dasabata, nikukoŋelamu nyidimu nehi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muyisu yampwembu yamukala iwu mwakeŋa ilaŋa anyanta nawatulamba, akashakama hetanda daDavidi dawanta, akendela mumakálu nihatuwalu, niwena nitulamba twawu, nawaYuda nawakushakama muYerusalema, nimukaliwu wakashakama haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akafuma munyikala yamuYuda, nikwatuŋ atuŋawu kwakwihi naYerusalema, nimwituŋa daBenjamini, nikunkulu, nikumapidi, nikukabeta kakuchidiilu akaletaleta nyilambu yakushita, niyimuna yakuketulaŋa, ninyilambu yawuŋa, nilibona, akaletaleta niyakusakilila nachu, kwitala daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi kwonti kwenu kutiyilila kudami chakujilika ifuku dasabata, mubuli kusendayiteli nakwijila nayu muyisu yampwembu yaYerusalema hefuku dasabata, ami nakabutula kesi muyisu yamukala iwu, kakadya matala amuYerusalema amaneni amawahi, hikakajimaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
